---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="A quick introduction to the person behind eainjon.es."
	pubDate={new Date('July 15 2024')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hey, I’m Eain—an independent developer and systems tinkerer currently based in the Pacific Northwest. I build
		content-driven websites, commerce experiences, and automation tooling for small teams that care about craft. My
		background spans design, engineering leadership, and operations, so I tend to float between strategy meetings and
		the terminal.
	</p>

	<p>
		My sweet spot is working with founders, nonprofits, and agencies that need a partner who can own the entire stack.
		I translate ideas into wireframes, build in Astro/Shopify/Eleventy, wire up analytics and automation, and document
		the path so you are never locked in. Long-term projects often include ongoing care plans where I monitor uptime,
		update dependencies, and make sure the site evolves with the org.
	</p>

	<h2>Things clients lean on me for</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Design-to-build marketing sites that stay fast on every device.</li>
		<li>Shopify storefronts that integrate with inventory, POS, and fulfillment tools.</li>
		<li>Technical documentation, onboarding runbooks, and lightweight operations coaching.</li>
		<li>Automation glue using Cloudflare Workers, Supabase, Airtable, and Notion.</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		When I am not shipping client work you will usually find me experimenting with new processes for teams: building
		internal dashboards, prototyping component libraries, and pruning operations backlogs. I believe small, boring
		tools win most battles. This site is a living lab where I share what I learn.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you want thoughtful partners who document as they go, let’s chat. The fastest way to reach me is via
		<a href="mailto:hello@eainjon.es">hello@eainjon.es</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
